        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/332363?u=9d22fb4cf5db8982204ada277d3f997ad998c6f8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The peer deps in <code class=\"notranslate\">@npmcli/eslint-config</code> are a couple majors behind:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">eslint</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">^8.13.0</code> -&gt; 10.x</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">eslint-plugin-node</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">^11.1.0</code> -&gt; deprecated, swap to <code class=\"notranslate\">eslint-plugin-n</code> 18.x</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">eslint-plugin-promise</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">^6.0.0</code> -&gt; 7.x</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">eslint 10 dropped legacy <code class=\"notranslate\">.eslintrc</code> so this also means moving <code class=\"notranslate\">lib/index.js</code> and the repo's own <code class=\"notranslate\">.eslintrc.js</code> to flat config.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/npm/eslint-config/blob/main/package.json\">https://github.com/npm/eslint-config/blob/main/package.json</a></li>\n</ul>",
